<p>Ukraine marked four years since Russia launched its full-scale invasion on February 24, 2022, as the war drags into a fifth year with no clear end in sight. Reports describe front lines that have largely hardened in place, with artillery and trench warfare continuing and Russian drone and missile strikes keeping civilians on frequent air-raid alert. Coverage also captures a two-track reality: sporadic talk of negotiations alongside steady fighting. Ukrainian officials and many Ukrainians say they are determined to resist, even as war fatigue deepens across the region. The anniversary also underscores the cumulative toll—mass displacement and very large military casualties—while allied governments use the moment to reaffirm support and acknowledge how hard diplomacy remains. Still, signs of resilience run through many accounts: people adapting to disrupted services through winter, communities finding ways to keep daily life going under air-raid warnings, and negotiators staying in contact even when trust is thin.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/8rEpjIOUM8yimq0-m23RpnXalZu_tVm0q3_Pp94vPmT3DKt2EQGnDYAb7mkKmTKOwiG8Kkn4FObCBvXANqAibkdN_Y0lGcQH7j-s8fRvEnztq3-8mYcs4xNgNxOnBK-uLMI0VOqzYNT6NMA5N_Pq4M_CbFqRagigvC5L89mZQ1jyJ-t6Qc2QspY6IcDrFTKHoWcbxbyxfcxRJf6e539Hn6S2Lmn5H9blKejjGQ' alt='Damage in Kyiv after a Russian attack, as the war enters its fifth year.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>War by numbers: A U.S.-based think tank estimate cited by PBS puts the number of soldiers on both sides killed, injured, or missing since the full-scale invasion began at up to 1.8 million.</li><li>Territory shifts: The Guardian, citing the Center for Strategic and International Studies, says Russia’s 2025 gains totaled about 1,865 square miles (around 0.8% of Ukraine) and describes advance rates of about 70 metres a day near Pokrovsk and 23 metres near Kupiansk.</li><li>War duration comparisons: Christian Science Monitor notes Russia has now been at war in Ukraine longer than the Soviet Union fought in World War II, underscoring the conflict’s length and rising costs.</li><li>Cities hit hard: SCMP describes extensive destruction in eastern and southern Ukraine, naming places such as Bakhmut, Toretsk, and Vovchansk as heavily damaged by fighting.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Ukrainian negotiator Sergiy Kyslytsya: Kyslytsya describes the personal toll and intensity of face-to-face talks with Russian representatives, emphasizing how difficult it feels to negotiate amid ongoing fighting. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c89k0lxlpnpo'>BBC News</a>)</li><li>Ukrainian society (resilience reporting): DW reports many Ukrainians remain determined to endure a harsh winter and ongoing attacks, portraying resilience as a defining feature four years in. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/ukrainian-resilience-remains-strong-as-war-enters-fifth-year/a-76065636'>Deutsche Welle</a>)</li><li>Russian public sentiment (war weariness): Christian Science Monitor reports that the prolonged war is starting to wear on Russia, even as the state continues pursuing its objectives. (<a href='https://www.csmonitor.com/World/Europe/2026/0223/ukraine-war-russia-anniversary-peace-talks'>The Christian Science Monitor</a>)</li><li>Ukraine’s stance on concessions: Al Jazeera reports Ukrainians it spoke to were repelled by the prospect of capitulating to Moscow, framing resistance as preferable to accepting imposed terms. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/24/devastation-and-frozen-frontlines-ukraine-marks-four-years-of-russias-war'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>Assessment of battlefield trajectory: The Guardian argues that Russia’s gains are small relative to Ukraine’s size and says portrayals of inevitable Ukrainian defeat do not match the pace of advances it cites. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/feb/24/four-years-ukraine-invasion-russia-gains-small-ukraine-remains-resilient'>The Guardian</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/33686274.html'>Ukraine Enters 5th Year Of Russia&#x27;s Full-Scale War Amid Both Talks And Fighting</a> - rferl.org</li><li><a href='https://www.csmonitor.com/World/Europe/2026/0223/ukraine-war-russia-anniversary-peace-talks'>Committed, but weary? Russia stays the course after four years of war in Ukraine.</a> - csmonitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/ukraine-marks-4-years-of-war-with-russia-amid-ongoing-conflict-volodymyr-zelensky-vladimir-putin-11128057#publisher=newsstand'>Ukraine Marks 4 Years of War With Russia Amid Ongoing Conflict</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/worldnews/comments/1rd4p5c/rworldnews_live_thread_russian_invasion_of/'>/r/WorldNews Live Thread: Russian Invasion of Ukraine Day 1461, Part 1 (Thread #1608)</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/ukrainian-resilience-remains-strong-as-war-enters-fifth-year/a-76065636'>Ukrainian resilience remains strong as war enters fifth year</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/02/23/nx-s1-5716910/ukraine-enters-fifth-year-with-no-end-in-sight'>Ukraine enters fifth year with no end in sight</a> - npr.org</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/ukraine-marks-four-years-since-russian-invasion/article70669719.ece'>Ukraine marks four years since Russian invasion</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/24/devastation-and-frozen-frontlines-ukraine-marks-four-years-of-russias-war'>Devastation and frozen frontlines: Ukraine marks four years of Russia’s war</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c89k0lxlpnpo'>Ukraine negotiator tells BBC how it feels to sit across table from Russia</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.spiked-online.com/2026/02/23/ukraine-is-bowed-but-unbroken/'>Ukraine is bowed but unbroken</a> - spiked-online.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/4-years-into-russias-invasion-of-ukraine-a-look-at-the-war-by-the-numbers'>4 years into Russia&#x27;s invasion of Ukraine, a look at the war by the numbers</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3344429/where-ukraine-and-russia-stand-war-enters-fifth-year'>Where Ukraine and Russia stand as war enters fifth year</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/feb/24/tuesday-briefing-long-and-winding-road-of-war-in-ukraine'>Tuesday briefing: The long and winding road of war in Ukraine, as the human cost mounts</a> - theguardian.com</li></ul>